                <pb facs="0627" n="543" xml:id="pg543"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Choate to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1903-08-14"><hi rendition="#italic">August 14,
                        1903</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Arranged that first meeting of Alaskan Boundary Commission shall be at foreign
                    office at 11 o’clock September 3. Please notify Secretary Root, General Foster,
                    and all the counsel.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Choate.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
